#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Manage your channel-specific notifications"
msgstr "채널별 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"By default, your web and desktop notification preferences apply to all "
"channels you’re a member of. You can customize your per-channel "
"notification preferences for any channel you're a member of for the "
"following actions:"
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 웹 및 데스크톱 알림 환경설정은 구성원으로 속한 모든 채널에 "
"적용됩니다. 구성원으로 속한 아무 채널에 대해 다음 동작에 대한 채널별 알림 "
"환경설정을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:9
msgid "`Mute channels <#mute-channels>`__"
msgstr "`채널 알림 끄기 <#mute-channels>`__"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:10
msgid "`Ignore channel-wide @mentions <#ignore-channel-wide-@mentions>`__"
msgstr "`채널 전체 @멘션 무시 <#ignore-channel-wide-@mentions>`__"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:11
msgid "`Message notification sounds <#message-notification-sounds>`__"
msgstr "`메시지 알림 소리 <#message-notification-sounds>`__"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:12
msgid "`Auto-follow all new threads <#auto-follow-all-new-channel-threads>`__"
msgstr "`모든 새 스레드 자동 팔로우 <#auto-follow-all-new-channel-threads>`__"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:16
msgid "You have 2 ways to manage notification preferences per channel:"
msgstr "채널별 알림 환경설정을 관리하는 방법은 두 가지가 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select the channel name, then select **Notification Preferences** from "
"the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"채널 이름을 선택한 다음 드롭다운 목록에서 **Notification Preferences**\\ 를 "
"선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:20
msgid ""
"Select the channel name dropdown to access channel-specific notification "
"preferences."
msgstr "채널 이름 드롭다운을 선택해 채널별 알림 환경설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:23
msgid ""
"Alternatively, select the channel's **View Info** |channel-info| icon, "
"and then select **Notification Preferences** in the right pane."
msgstr ""
"또는 채널의 **View Info** |channel-info| 아이콘을 선택한 다음 오른쪽 창에서 "
"**Notification Preferences**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:13
msgid "Use the Channel Info icon to access additional channel management options."
msgstr "채널 정보 아이콘을 사용해 추가 채널 관리 옵션에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:27
msgid "Tap the channel name, and then tap **Mobile Notifications**."
msgstr "채널 이름을 탭한 다음 **Mobile Notifications**\\ 를 탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:30
msgid "Mute channels"
msgstr "채널 알림 끄기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:32
msgid ""
"All channels are unmuted by default, including direct and group messages,"
" as well as private and public channels."
msgstr ""
"개인 메시지와 그룹 메시지, 비공개 채널과 공개 채널을 포함한 모든 채널은 "
"기본적으로 알림이 켜져 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:34
msgid "You can choose to mute or unmute a channel at any time as follows:"
msgstr "다음과 같이 언제든지 채널의 알림을 끄거나 켜도록 선택할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:36
msgid ""
"Select **Mute Conversation** or **Unmute Conversation** for direct and "
"group messages."
msgstr ""
"개인 메시지와 그룹 메시지의 경우 **Mute Conversation** 또는 **Unmute "
"Conversation**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:37
msgid ""
"Select **Mute Channel** or **Unmute Channel** for private and public "
"channels."
msgstr ""
"비공개 채널과 공개 채널의 경우 **Mute Channel** 또는 **Unmute Channel**\\ 을 "
"선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:39
msgid "Once a channel is muted:"
msgstr "채널 알림을 끄면:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:41
msgid ""
"All notifications for that channel are disabled, including email, "
"desktop, incoming call ring tones, and push notifications."
msgstr ""
"이메일, 데스크톱, 수신 통화 벨소리, 푸시 알림을 포함해 그 채널의 모든 알림이 "
"비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:42
msgid "The muted channel displays a mute icon next to the channel name."
msgstr "알림이 꺼진 채널은 채널 이름 옆에 음소거 아이콘을 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:43
msgid ""
"The channel is greyed out in the channel sidebar, and doesn't appear bold"
" to indicate unread messages unless you’re :doc:`@mentioned </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/mention-people>` in that channel directly."
msgstr ""
"채널은 채널 사이드바에서 회색으로 표시되며, 그 채널에서 직접 :doc:`@멘션 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>`\\ 되지 않는 한 읽지 않은 "
"메시지를 나타내는 굵은 표시가 나타나지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:46
msgid "Ignore channel-wide @mentions"
msgstr "채널 전체 @멘션 무시"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:48
msgid ""
"By default, you're notified every time someone uses channel-wide "
":doc:`@mentions </end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>` including "
":ref:`@channel and @all <end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-"
"people:@channel and @all>`, as well as :ref:`@here <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/mention-people:@here>`."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 누군가가 :ref:`@channel 및 @all <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/mention-people:@channel and @all>`\\ 과 :ref:`@here <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/mention-people:@here>`\\ 를 포함한 채널 전체 :doc:`@멘션 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>`\\ 을 사용할 때마다 알림을 "
"받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:50
msgid ""
"When you choose to ignore channel-wide @mentions in channels, the channel"
" name is bolded in the channel sidebar for new unreads unless it's muted."
msgstr ""
"채널에서 채널 전체 @멘션을 무시하도록 선택하면, 채널이 음소거되지 않은 한 새 "
"읽지 않은 항목에 대해 채널 이름이 채널 사이드바에서 굵게 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:53
msgid "Message notification sounds"
msgstr "메시지 알림 소리"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:55
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.1, when you configure Mattermost to notify you about "
"all new messages, or mentions, direct messages, and keywords only, on a "
"per-channel basis, you can also specify an audible message notification "
"sound to play for those notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v10.1부터 채널별로 모든 새 메시지 또는 멘션·개인 메시지·키워드에 "
"대해서만 알림을 받도록 OKR.BEST를 구성할 때, 그러한 알림에 재생할 들리는 메시지 "
"알림 소리를 지정할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:58
msgid "Follow all new channel threads"
msgstr "모든 새 채널 스레드 팔로우"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:60
msgid ""
"By default, you don’t automatically follow new conversation threads in "
"any channel unless you start a thread or reply to a thread, follow a "
"thread, or are @mentioned in a thread."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 스레드를 시작하거나, 스레드에 답글을 달거나, 스레드를 "
"팔로우하거나, 스레드에서 @멘션되지 않는 한 어떤 채널의 새 대화 스레드도 자동으로 "
"팔로우하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:62
msgid ""
"When using Mattermost on your mobile device, you can configure Mattermost"
" to automatically follow every thread in a channel."
msgstr ""
"모바일 기기에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때 채널의 모든 스레드를 자동으로 팔로우하도록 "
"OKR.BEST를 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:64
msgid ""
"In a channel, tap the **More** icon |more-icon| to the right of the "
"channel name."
msgstr "채널에서 채널 이름 오른쪽의 **More** 아이콘 |more-icon|\\ 를 탭합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:16
msgid "Use the More icon to access additional message options."
msgstr "더 보기 아이콘을 사용해 추가 메시지 옵션에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:65
msgid "Tap **View info**."
msgstr "**View info**\\ 를 탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:66
msgid "Tap **Follow all threads**."
msgstr "**Follow all threads**\\ 를 탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications.rst:68
msgid ""
"Tap **Threads** in the channel list to access all threads you're "
"following, and to unfollow threads you no longer want to follow."
msgstr ""
"채널 목록에서 **Threads**\\ 를 탭해 팔로우 중인 모든 스레드에 접근하고, 더 "
"이상 팔로우하고 싶지 않은 스레드를 팔로우 해제합니다."

